# Workflow: CI Optimization

Purpose:
   Specify CI/CD rules for optimizing test execution based on change impact.
   Only changed modules tested on PRs; full system tests only on merge to
   main/test/prod branches.

Owns: workflow/ci-optimization.sdd

CIRules:
   - Only changed modules tested on PR
   - Full system tests only on merge to test/prod
   - Docker layer caching
   - Concurrency limits
   - Skip workflows for docs-only changes
   - Security scans only when security-related files changed
   - Performance tests on schedule and merge to main
   - Acceptance tests on merge to test/prod

TriggerConditions:
   PR opened/synchronize/reopened:
     - Run detect-changes job
     - If modules changed: run module-tests job for each affected module
     - If security files changed: run security-scan job
   Push to main:
     - Run full-integration job (E2E, performance, regression)
   Push to test/prod:
     - Run full-integration job + acceptance tests

Optimizations:
   - Docker layer caching: Use actions/cache for Docker layers
   - Matrix testing: Parallel execution of module tests
   - Concurrency limits: Limit concurrent jobs to prevent resource exhaustion
   - Artifact caching: Cache test reports and coverage between jobs
   - Early termination: Fail fast on critical failures

